# The one place a tool version is pinned.
#
# Sourced by scripts/install-dependencies.sh, which provisions a workstation,
# and read as build arguments by .github/runner-image/Dockerfile, which builds
# the image CI runs steward in. Those two have to agree: a plan produced by one
# version of tofu and applied by another is the kind of difference nobody sees
# until it matters, and "works on my machine" is the whole failure mode a
# self-hosted runner invites.
#
# tests/go/repo/versions_test.go asserts the Dockerfile takes its versions from
# here rather than restating them.
#
# Keys are alphabetical because dotenv-linter (which Super-Linter runs over
# anything ending in .env - see the note atop .github/super-linter.vars) fails
# the build on UnorderedKey otherwise. Grouping them by what they are for reads
# better and is not worth a red check; nothing here depends on the order.
FLUX_VERSION=2.7.1
GO_VERSION=1.26.7
NODE_VERSION=24.19.0
RCLONE_VERSION=1.75.0
TALOSCTL_VERSION=v1.13.8
TOFU_VERSION=1.12.6
